stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> EventCreated: New Event
    
    EventCreated --> Published: PublishEvent()
    
    Published --> InKafka: Kafka Accepts
    Published --> PublishFailed: Kafka Error
    
    PublishFailed --> RetryPublish: Retry < MaxRetries
    PublishFailed --> Failed: Max Retries Exceeded
    
    RetryPublish --> Published: Retry Publish
    
    InKafka --> Consumed: Consumer Reads
    InKafka --> Expired: TTL Exceeded
    
    Consumed --> Processing: Handler Invoked
    
    Processing --> Processed: Success
    Processing --> ProcessingError: Handler Error
    
    ProcessingError --> RetryProcessing: Retry < MaxRetries
    ProcessingError --> DeadLetter: Max Retries Exceeded
    
    RetryProcessing --> Processing: Retry Handler
    
    Processed --> Committed: Offset Committed
    
    DeadLetter --> DLQPublished: Publish to DLQ
    
    DLQPublished --> ManualReview: Admin Action
    DLQPublished --> Reprocessed: Auto Retry
    
    Reprocessed --> Processing: Reprocess Event
    
    ManualReview --> [*]: Resolved
    Committed --> [*]: Complete
    Failed --> [*]: Abandoned
    Expired --> [*]: Timeout
    
    note right of EventCreated
        Event Types:
        - ProcessingEvent
        - ReviewEvent
        - HotelEvent
        - ProviderEvent
        - SystemEvent
    end note
    
    note right of Processing
        Handlers:
        - ProcessingEventHandler
        - ReviewEventHandler
        - RetryableEventHandler
    end note
    
    note right of DeadLetter
        DLQ contains:
        - Original message
        - Error details
        - Retry count
        - Timestamps
    end note